sists of (1) personnel costs and (2) procurement costs, mainly including our costs of procuring third party recruitment services, commodities and raw materials. The following table sets forth a breakdown of our cost of revenues by nature, both by absolute amount and as a percentage of our total revenues for the periods indicated.","context":"Cost of revenues","section":"Key Components of Results of Operations","block":900,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-050196","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002028177","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2028177/000121390026050196/ea0285866-20f_youlife.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5c071d1d3f4e648066990cab5f20e0019ed4c8b52880b81c8c8ec3b79628d041.bin","sha256":"5c071d1d3f4e648066990cab5f20e0019ed4c8b52880b81c8c8ec3b79628d041"}},{"id":"bb08d1d8c1d105ed3fd8240c74c234b2103889259810bfeebe4d41e0225d9aa5","quote":"| | For the Year Ended December 31, | | | 2023 | | | 2024 | | | 2025 | | | RMB | | | % | | | RMB | | | % | | | RMB | | | US$ | | | % | | | (in thousands, except for percentages) | Personnel costs | | | 929,097 | | | | 65.5 | | | | 949,906 | | | | 59.9 | | | | 1,049,427 | | | | 150,066 | | | | 56.6 | Procurement costs | | | 217,504 | | | | 15.3 | | | | 336,837 | | | | 21.2 | | | | 586,131 | | | | 83,816 | | | | 31.6 | Others | | | 45,209 | | | | 3.2 | | | | 69,768 | | | | 4.4 | | | | 26,678 | | | | 3,815 | | | | 1.4 | Total | | | 1,191,810 | | | | 84.0 | | | | 1,356,511 | | | | 85.5 | | | | 1,662,236 | | | | 237,697 | | | | 89.6 | Less: cost of revenues from the discontinued operations | | | 26,364 | | | | 50.5 | | | | - | | | | - | | | | - | | | | - | | | | - | Cost of revenues from the continuing operations | | | 1,165,446 | | | | 85.3 | | | | 1,356,511 | | | | 85.5 | | | | 1,662,236 | | | | 237,697 | | | | 89.6 |","context":"Our cost of sales primarily consists of (1) pers