ts consolidated financial statements.","section":"Business combination","block":1114,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-050196","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002028177","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2028177/000121390026050196/ea0285866-20f_youlife.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5c071d1d3f4e648066990cab5f20e0019ed4c8b52880b81c8c8ec3b79628d041.bin","sha256":"5c071d1d3f4e648066990cab5f20e0019ed4c8b52880b81c8c8ec3b79628d041"}},{"id":"9f8600d9ceb9190faf91d985c53da62ce234afb04f610fd398e4087869733b3f","quote":"102","context":"In November 2024, the FASB issued ASU No. 2024-03, Income Statement—Reporting Comprehensive Income—Expense Disaggregation Disclosures (Subtopic 220-40): Disaggregation of Income Statement Expenses (collectively with subsequent amendments in ASU 2025-01, “ASU 2024-03”). This ASU requires new financial statement disclosures disaggregating prescribed expense categories within relevant income statement expense captions. ASU 2024-03 will be effective for the Company beginning December 15, 2026. Early adoption is permitted. We are currently evaluating the impact of adopting the standard.","section":"Business combination","block":1115,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-050196","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002028177","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2028177/000121390026050196/ea0285866-20f_youlife.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5c071d1d3f4e648066990cab5f20e0019ed4c8b52880b81c8c8ec3b79628d041.bin","sha256":"5c071d1d3f4e648066990cab5f20e0019ed4c8b52880b81c8c8ec3b79628d041"}},{"id":"869f90547fd5a3303fb05829f3ad4f9c5f722699aaee3e3ab2c533d48feaf7d4","quote":"The Group’s business activities, for which discrete financial information is available, are r